### Prueba de vida
GET http://localhost:3000/api/test

### Registrar un nuevo usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/singup
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "name": "Juan Perez",
    "password": "123456",
    "email": "jp@gmail.com"
}

### Iniciar sesión
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "password": "123456",
    "email": "jp@gmail.com"
}

